ull HTML I already have (it was truncated). Let me grep the saved file for \"Implementation Details\" and training time info.\n\nActually the truncated output is saved to /home/hal/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_14be81b99001zXqh27CWLeNLh8. Let me grep that.\n\nLet me also fetch the Rita paper HTML for protocol details, and check the gismo config files for hyperparameters (batch size, epochs).\n\nLet me first grep the saved GISMo HTML for Appendix A details."
